# Private files
PRIVATE_*.md
# Private overlay: a separate PRIVATE git repo cloned here (backlog, notes, agentic
# infra). Versioned + synced via its own remote; never part of this public repo.
.private/
# Internal docs (live in .private/docs/ — source for generation and reference)
docs/
# Agentic infrastructure (all local-only; never publish to the public repo)
# ---
# Generated instruction files — rebuild with `pnpm run generate:assistant-docs`
# (reads from .private/docs/assistant-workflow.md)
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
# Claude Code project directory: subagents, slash commands, prompts, settings.
# Agentic infra belongs here (local) or in the private overlay (.private/).
# The whole directory is ignored so future additions are private by default.
.claude/

